{"format":"frame-text","version":1,"id":"7fb314a8-c3a2-4346-a1be-520f99b52b01","title":"Réunion de bureau du 2 juin 2026","created":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","modified":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","settings":{"autoIndent":false,"titleInText":true,"columns":{"count":1,"rule":false},"index":[],"comments":[],"theme":{"v":1,"id":"carnet","name":"Carnet","note":"Nunito, titre manuscrit, rouge tomate et vert tige.","modified":false,"text":{"font":"Nunito","size":11.5,"line":1.6,"space":0.6,"align":"","indent":""},"accent":"#c8402c","styles":{"title":{"font":"Caveat","size":32,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},"headings":[{"font":"Nunito","size":17,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":14,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2f7d32","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":false,"italic":true,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":true,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""}],"bullets":[{"symbol":"•","color":"#c8402c"},{"symbol":"◦","color":""},{"symbol":"▪","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""}]},"table":{"style":"raye","color":"theme","header":true,"first":false,"total":false,"last":false,"bands":true,"bandcols":false,"sep":false,"font":"","size":0,"pad":""},"callout":{"look":"fond","color":""},"quote":{"look":"fond","color":""},"toc":{"title":"Plan","showTitle":true,"titleStyle":"petites-capitales","titleAlign":"gauche","docTitle":false,"levels":2,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","frame":"cadre","number":"titres","leaders":true,"indent":true,"preset":"compact"},"diagram":{"fill":"#fde2e1","stroke":"#e74c3c","textColor":"#78281f","link":"#c0392b","font":"Segoe UI","strokeWidth":1.5,"shadow":false,"palette":false},"margins":null},"mode":"note","pages":{"size":"A4","w":210,"h":297,"orient":"portrait","turned":{},"margins":{"top":25,"bottom":25,"left":25,"right":25},"numbers":{"on":true,"pos":"bas-centre","format":"1","from":1,"first":1,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"box":"aucun","skip":{}},"header":{"on":true,"html":""},"footer":{"on":true,"html":""},"firstDifferent":false,"keep":true,"tagsAfterCover":true,"custom":false}},"content":{"html":"<h1 class=\"ft-title\">Réunion de bureau</h1><p><i>Mardi 2 juin 2026, à la cabane du jardin. Présents : Claire Martin, Julien Roche, Amina Benali, Paul Girard.</i></p><h2>Point sur les décisions de mars</h2><p>Suivi des actions votées lors de l’<a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"f6dc14e7-ab0c-4694-a244-928a5320d232\" title=\"Lien vers « Assemblée générale du 14 mars 2026 » (double-clic : ouvrir ; clic droit : autres choix)\">assemblée générale du 14 mars</a>. Le récupérateur d’eau a été installé le 12 mai 2026, avec trois jours d’avance.</p><table class=\"ft-table\" data-t=\"2\" data-style=\"clair\" data-color=\"bleu\" data-header=\"oui\" data-bands=\"oui\" data-first=\"oui\" data-sep=\"oui\"><tbody><tr><td>Action</td><td>Responsable</td><td>Échéance</td><td>État</td></tr><tr><td>Récupérateur d’eau</td><td>Paul</td><td>15 mai</td><td>Fait</td></tr><tr><td>Devis serre</td><td>Paul</td><td>30 juin</td><td>En cours</td></tr><tr><td>Commande semences</td><td>Julien</td><td>31 mars</td><td>Fait</td></tr><tr><td>Accueil des classes</td><td>Amina</td><td>19 juin</td><td>Prévu</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Arrosage pendant l’été</h2><p>Un tour d’arrosage est organisé du 1er juillet au 31 août, selon la <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"c16aab0b-7bd0-488f-a90a-548fa691e914\" title=\"Lien vers « Fiche – Arrosage et paillage » (double-clic : ouvrir ; clic droit : autres choix)\">fiche technique</a>. Les tomates seront paillées avant le départ en congés, comme prévu au <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"18d16dba-de1a-488c-a11e-840476d5a115\" title=\"Lien vers « Calendrier des semis » (double-clic : ouvrir ; clic droit : autres choix)\">calendrier</a>.</p><blockquote class=\"ft-callout\" data-look=\"trait\" data-color=\"bleu\"><p>Prochaine réunion : mardi 1er septembre 2026, 18&nbsp;h 30.</p></blockquote>"},"tags":[{"name":"Réunion","color":"bleu"},{"name":"2026","color":"jaune"}],"links":[],"meta":{}}